== b10_cond
  san:    exit 134 use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written|
  O3:     exit 0 cond 12|
  interp: exit 1 olang interpret: b10_cond.olang:30: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/b10_cond.debug.san
--- run san
use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written
--- run O3
cond 12
--- interpret
olang interpret: b10_cond.olang:30: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed
